---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const videoId = '4AEO1smpvzs';
---

<Layout title="Mike Trounce — Fundraise Readiness for Early-Stage Founders">
  <div id="top" class="hero">
    <div class="video-frame" id="video-frame" data-video-id={videoId}>
      <img
        class="video-thumb"
        src={`https://img.youtube.com/vi/${videoId}/maxresdefault.jpg`}
        alt=""
        loading="lazy"
        onerror={`this.onerror=null; this.src='https://img.youtube.com/vi/${videoId}/hqdefault.jpg';`}
      />
      <button class="play-btn" id="play-btn" aria-label="Play video">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <p class="video-caption">Click to play</p>
  </div>

  <div class="bio">
    <p>
      I&rsquo;m Mike &mdash; I work with founders who&rsquo;ve already got real traction (some revenue,
      a first raise through their own network) and need to get ready for a serious institutional
      round. Over about ten working sessions I get the whole company out of your head and onto
      paper &mdash; the story, the people, the product, the numbers &mdash; and I don&rsquo;t publish a
      word of it until I&rsquo;m sure it&rsquo;s actually true.
    </p>
    <div class="signature">Mike</div>
  </div>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section id="approach">
      <span class="eyebrow">How this works</span>
      <h2>One version of the truth, ready for diligence.</h2>
      <p>Most founders at this stage don&rsquo;t need a better pitch deck &mdash; they need the real story of the company written down properly, once, and checked against what&rsquo;s actually true. That&rsquo;s what the working sessions are for.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="work">
      <span class="eyebrow">The process</span>
      <h2>Ten sessions. Three things come out of them.</h2>
      <div class="work-grid">
        <div class="work-card">
          <div class="work-thumb" style="background:var(--illus-b)"></div>
          <h3>Get it out of your head</h3>
          <p>Around ten one-hour sessions covering the story, the people, the product, and the numbers &mdash; in your words first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-card">
          <div class="work-thumb" style="background:var(--illus-d)"></div>
          <h3>Check it, don&rsquo;t just record it</h3>
          <p>Nothing gets published as settled until it&rsquo;s been checked back against you &mdash; no guessing, no filled-in gaps.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-card">
          <div class="work-thumb" style="background:var(--illus-c)"></div>
          <h3>One source of truth</h3>
          <p>A verified, investor-ready record you can point to instead of rebuilding the story every time someone asks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="favorites">
      <span class="eyebrow">A few things I like</span>
      <h2>Off the desk, for what it&rsquo;s worth</h2>
      <ul class="fav-list">
        <li><span><strong>The book I keep recommending:</strong> [add yours &mdash; e.g. The Mom Test]</span></li>
        <li><span><strong>Podcast for the commute:</strong> [add yours]</span></li>
        <li><span><strong>Tool I couldn&rsquo;t consult without:</strong> [add yours]</span></li>
        <li><span><strong>One indulgence:</strong> too much coffee</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <footer id="contact">
      <span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span>
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:14px;">Got something worth building?</h2>
      <p class="contact-line">Send me a note &mdash; I read everything myself.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;"><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:trounceflow@gmail.com">trounceflow@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p class="foot-note">Mike &middot; Startup Consultant &middot; Based in [add your city]</p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  const frame = document.getElementById('video-frame');
  const playBtn = document.getElementById('play-btn');
  const caption = document.querySelector('.video-caption');
  if (frame && playBtn) {
    playBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const id = frame.getAttribute('data-video-id');
      const iframe = document.createElement('iframe');
      iframe.src = `https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/${id}?autoplay=1&rel=0&modestbranding=1&iv_load_policy=3`;
      iframe.title = 'Video';
      iframe.allow = 'autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen';
      iframe.allowFullscreen = true;
      frame.innerHTML = '';
      frame.appendChild(iframe);
      caption?.remove();
    });
  }
</script>
